  "summary": "Renaissance Revival refers to a trend originating from the 1990s that reinterprets elements from fashion and art of the Renaissance through a cotemporary lens.",
  "description": "Renaissance Revival refers to a trend originating from the 1990s that reinterprets elements from fashion and art of the Renaissance through a cotemporary lens. It is defined by imagery reminiscent of the Renaissance era, drawing inspiration from fairytales, Greco-Roman paintings and art styles from the Middle Ages and Elizabethan period. The aesthetic often uses warm muted colors, sepia filters/textures and renaissance script fonts to evoke a sense of antique quality.",
